    "solution_hi": "<p><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"0\"><span>सही जवाब <u><strong>केकड़े</strong></u> है।</span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"1\"><span> </span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"2\"><span>विकल्पों में से, केवल<strong> केकड़ा </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"\">जंतु</span><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"2\"><span> जगत के आर्थ्रोपोडा संघ के अंतर्गत आता है।</span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Key Points</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"0\"><span><strong>आर्थ्रोपोडा संघ </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"\">जंतु</span><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"0\"><span> जगत में सबसे बड़ा संघ है।</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"2\"><span>पृथ्वी पर सभी नामित प्रजातियों में से दो तिहाई से अधिक आर्थ्रोपोडा हैं।</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"0\"><span>आर्थ्रोपोडा संघ </span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"4\"><span> को पहली बार 1845 में <strong>वॉन सीबोल्ड </strong>ने बनाया था।</span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"6\"><span>आर्थ्रोपोडा का शरीर एक <strong>चिटिनस एक्सोस्केलेटन </strong>द्वारा कवर किया गया है।</span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"7\"><span> </span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"8\"><span>आर्थ्रोपोडा के शरीर में एक सिर, वक्ष और पेट होते हैं।</span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"9\"><span> </span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"0\"><span>आर्थ्रोपोडा संघ </span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"10\"><span>के <strong>संयुक्त उपांग</strong> होते हैं।</span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"11\"><span> </span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"12\"><span>आर्थ्रोपोडा के श्वसन अंग गलफड़े, बुक गलफड़े, बुक फेफड़े या श्वासनली प्रणाली हैं।</span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"13\"><span> </span></span></span></li>\n\t<li>आर्थ्रोपोडा में परिसंचरण तंत्र <strong>खुले प्रकार</strong> का होता है।</li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"16\"><span>आर्थ्रोपोडा में उत्सर्जन </span></span></span><strong><span class=\"aCOpRe\"><span>मैलपीगी </span></span></strong><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"16\"><span><strong>नलिकाओं</strong> के माध्यम से होता है।</span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"https://cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"0\"><span>आर्थ्रोपोडा संघ के महत्वपूर्ण उदाहरण हैं:</span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"1\"><span> </span></span> </span>\n\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"2\"><span>कॉकरोच</span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"4\"><span>झींगा</span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li><strong><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"6\"><span>केकड़ा</span></span></span></strong></li>\n\t\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"8\"><span>बिच्छू</span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"10\"><span>सेंटीपीड</span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"12\"><span>मक्खी</span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"14\"><span>टिक्स</span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"16\"><span>घुन</span></span></span></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"18\"><span><strong>तारामीन</strong> </span></span></span><span style=\"\">जंतु</span><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"18\"><span> जगत के एकाइनोडर्मेटा संघ के अंतर्गत आते हैं।</span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"19\"><span> </span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"20\"><span><strong>जेलीफ़िश</strong> </span></span></span><span style=\"\">जंतु</span><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"20\"><span> जगत के </span></span></span><span class=\"aCOpRe\"><span>नाइडेरिया संघ</span></span><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"20\"><span> के अंतर्गत आते हैं।</span></span><span class=\"JLqJ4b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"21\"><span> </span></span></span></li>\n\t<li><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"22\"><span><strong>सीप </strong></span></span></span><span style=\"\">जंतु</span><span class=\"VIiyi\" lang=\"hi\"><span class=\"JLqJ4b ChMk0b\" data-language-for-alternatives=\"hi\" data-language-to-translate-into=\"en\" data-phrase-index=\"22\"><span> जगत के मोलस्का संघ के अंतर्गत आते हैं।</span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
